My computer just went

00:38:51.276 --> 00:38:53.598
through a messy divorce.

00:38:54.147 --> 00:38:55.625
She ended up getting a C

00:38:55.627 --> 00:38:57.605
drive, and he got the D drive.

00:38:58.230 --> 00:39:00.317
This is Darknet Diaries.

